# Luminary — nuke-install.sh adopter-facing script

- date: 2026-09-29
- branch: feat/nuke-install-script
- lead: alan-cooper
- supporting: [michael-feathers]

## Lead: alan-cooper

CLI shape matters. Cold adopter has one job: install cli fresh, no cruft. Cooper's lens: reduce interaction cost. One command via `curl | bash`, minimal flags, sensible defaults.

## Supporting: michael-feathers

Characterization tests pin observable behavior — help output shape, dry-run mode, flag parsing. Fixture-based; no live npm calls in tests.
